## Task

Map this cluster to ONE of the predefined themes above. If the cluster clearly belongs to multiple themes equally, respond with "MULTI". If it doesn't fit any theme well, respond with "UNMAPPED".

## Output Format
Respond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact format:
```json
{
    "theme_id": "the_theme_id_or_MULTI_or_UNMAPPED",
    "confidence": 0.85,
    "reasoning": "Brief explanation of why this theme was chosen"
}
```

Important:
- confidence should be between 0.0 and 1.0
- Use MULTI only if the cluster genuinely spans multiple themes equally
- Use UNMAPPED only if no theme fits at all
- Be decisive - most clusters should map to exactly one theme

